    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:560c409621ff5860dd799a7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ファインモーションの競技生活は3年間のみ。\r\n彼女はいずれ国へ帰り、\r\n使命を果たさなければならない身だ……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5510abf13563e4e1b2c30e76c2c9eb60102c1f0e493401184f4de1a86effe9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:924afe6ba96585029ad75783",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b3cb4023f041c5d20192d2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "だが、彼女は今を全力で楽しんでいる。\r\nトレーナーは、限られた時間を充実させ、\r\n彼女の夢を叶えると誓うのだった……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbf5cc8ce6564ca3b26c446f4af14f63234066cbfb15376d57887cc9b7698e60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f281419994f7c5cfe9cf2cdc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da34cc7f083a153ef0348c46d2bf5bce9178775ae02a63aa047e4e0a902d8ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f51bf9f19003af629fd9c7e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368c18fb820bfedcf7d91140",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーナーを連れ出し、街へ出た\r\nファインモーション！　彼女は普通の\r\n学生らしい経験を大喜びで楽しむ……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "117ba5fd5327b7060ec0011fd13234c904294b12ff921fcbb6f41b3e49916893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8580e66ff7b7ba6083e75ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:925743a8013259c37742fa15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "やがて彼女は自分の立場について語り始める。\r\n大事に育てられた感謝と、責務から逃れたい\r\nと思ったことはないということ。なぜなら――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2cc63b57b96a6414847a8accea2090e768690420940ecdf58dac5ba91e5d7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e726fd4c09321fe34f123871",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3d7af2692af7827c512983",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『祖国の繁栄の礎となることが\r\n己の使命』だから――\r\nファインモーションは、そう断言した。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eba8b7de6a69c9fa4538feaa3e51e20b8cd18dde5308a3085c2eb466e2fbbcea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37ac8b0c6a6972a3391075b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:756383bbe8ce7d10ca1dd72e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今、日本にいるのも『礎』となるためだ。\r\nトレーナーはそんな彼女に、レースで\r\nもっと高みの景色を見せたいと思うのだった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340edca0dbe853ce4e45383cd2b19c783e4ed8218e3fca52e78236e6af3fc6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a5bdd7e89bb47ecc5740cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "This Is Who I Am",
      "source_fingerprint": "663e6c0f9817b4febd08b1c1e3b3efef84293bb8d48262917532f2ae3c4b5aae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff485037495f01dee76d6198",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "理論派のウマ娘、エアシャカール。彼女は\r\nファインモーションとの会話を鬱陶しがり\r\nながらも、そのデータには興味があるようだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "982f5ed71c98c56563dd30d42ecf456dfad4e028b50e619f8bb586eaee92fbc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8efedb67f3ce672a49dede4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "コイツは他のウマ娘とは明らかに違う――\r\nエアシャカールはそこに、己の運命を\r\n変える可能性を見出していた……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d66c81576f621730e6a51532c005797b8f342f12e6f79181669d72d711b540",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:582bd6bbe0e1a50b95be0e0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "エアシャカールは意味深な言葉を口走る。\r\nコイツのコト、ちゃンと見とけ――\r\n“最後まで”走らせンのがお前の仕事だ――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a701b0394a6bd6e44b35ce7175848601bff7a718c67cf2a525b18e93f9699f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:057b15c6976b4b994cb6b6a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "彼女には一体、何が見えているのか……？\r\n胸に留めるトレーナーだった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa64c26fe20fe3eeab61ea0ce8ab495c12608cb161079ebc4432380a26dc119",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060e31348912301cfaa96801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "My Dear...",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d45a43071350505856f5e82f298e88fb02d8442fad868ae67c733c28fbbc81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9a772414969fa096a8f415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c94201ed55402ef5650cfb8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ『エリザベス女王杯』が始まる……！\r\nファインモーションは同室のウマ娘、\r\nエアグルーヴからそのレースのことを聞く。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d80dd886d37db39405078c17b6cb0b5cccae843494013b0385f714ae8165052",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc24d814a4738303c6bb3485",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f78d5f5a6c2e2522cd20796",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "かつてエアグルーヴも走ったそのレースは、\r\n誇りと敬意に満ちた偉大なレースで……\r\n“女王”の名にふさわしい特別な舞台だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ac54ce8e1b5ba8f65334f2bdd08f09f7d260ed3bcfe6399dac8739a522ef6ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553830d1cb3eac7fa38d060c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698ab55ea6d1e4ecfcc497b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ファインモーションはトレーナーと\r\n共に中継を観戦した。彼女は『勝ちたい』\r\n想いが激しくぶつかるレースに感銘を受ける。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e5af3dc6afce99f09b9bae322e14a483f495ab9354dadbaf148ad95f60d1c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727116370e0e058c1e0de31a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
